IELTS Teacher

We are seeking a dedicated IELTS Teacher to join our program and support learners preparing for the International English Language Testing System (IELTS). The role focuses on delivering engaging instruction, assessing progress, and guiding students toward improved performance across the exam’s components in a supportive learning environment.

About the Role
As an IELTS Teacher, you will design and deliver high-quality lessons aligned with IELTS objectives. You will assess learners’ progress, provide constructive feedback, and adapt teaching strategies to meet diverse needs. You will collaborate with colleagues to maintain effective curriculum delivery and support learners on their pathway to success in reading, listening, writing, and overall language proficiency.

Responsibilities
- Plan and deliver IELTS-focused lessons and practice activities across listening, reading, writing, and speaking components (as part of exam preparation).
- Assess learner progress using established criteria and provide timely feedback to support improvement.
- Develop and adapt lesson plans, activities, and materials to accommodate different proficiency levels and learning styles.
- Maintain accurate records of student progress and attendance.
- Implement effective classroom management to create an engaging and respectful learning environment.
- Align instruction with curriculum goals and standards while incorporating appropriate assessment methods.
- Employ a range of teaching strategies to promote language development, test-taking skills, and exam strategies.
- Communicate with learners and, where applicable, with parents or guardians regarding progress and expectations.
- Engage in ongoing professional development to stay current with IELTS formats and instructional best practices.

